# Hardlight Containment: "Enchant artifact you control" (CR 303.4): Bot1's Plains (not an artifact) and Bot2's Ornithopter
# (not Bot1's) are refused, its Memnite (an artifact creature) is enchanted. "When this Aura enters, exile target creature an
# opponent controls until this Aura leaves the battlefield" (CR 610.3): Bot1's own Memnite is not a legal target, Bot2's
# Ornithopter#1 is (Ornithopter#2 is the other candidate). "Enchanted permanent has ward {1}": on turn 4 Bot2's Lightning Bolt
# at the Memnite is countered unless Bot2 pays {1}; Bot2 has exactly {R}{R}, so Bolt takes one and the ward the other, and the
# Bolt then resolves, killing the Memnite. With the Aura gone the Ornithopter returns (a new object).

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Memnite
Mox Pearl
Hardlight Containment
Plains x3
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby x2
Lightning Bolt
Ornithopter x2
Island x2
Island x14

